Using Helm we will install Certification Manager (cert-manager)

1) Add the helm repo of cert-manager
if you dont have helm first install it. 
by 
choco install kubernetes-helm

2) Then open your git-bash or powershell to add helm repo
----
helm repo add jetstack https://charts.jetstack.io
helm repo update

kubectl create namespace cert-manager
helm install cert-manager jetstack/cert-manager  --namespace cert-manager --set crds.enabled=true


3) Verify installation
kubectl get pods -n cert-manager
kubectl get crd | grep cert-manager
